      "text": "The documented project layout includes agent.py (LLM loop, tool calling, context management), cli.py (Rich streaming CLI), tools/ (code_tools.py, basic_tools.py), extensions/ (mcp_client.py, orchestrator.py), skills.py, config.py, memory.py, and utils/."
